{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>荃灣有人猝死。今日（28日）凌晨4時許，一名35歲周姓男保安員在蕙荃路22至66號商場「綠楊坊」地下一間保安室暈倒，同事見狀報案，周男昏迷由救護車送院搶救，最終不治，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，事主有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主送院不治。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261128/1203238633792868352091643.jpeg/TXBvJitdQp5ErowmMA_CetPS8Q-9ghkxbwTWHFUE1hw\"/><figcaption>事主送院不治。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:12:38.973764+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:49:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T01:17:27.087183+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:06:06.281221+00:00","content_hash":"9b94fa28eede1d01c6f7e08bfead5c463dd96cfbc32a2709de1be1c1af1b3d35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}